# Sky's The Limit 2026 hackathon data: licensed, must not be committed.
# The GRID starter data lives in a separate repo next to this project.
# Committing it (even to a private repo) is redistribution, which the
# GRID license prohibits. Verified before every push:
#   git ls-files | grep -Ei '\.(zst|jsonl|parquet|sqlite|duckdb)$|stl-hackathon-2026-grid-starter'
# must print nothing.
stl-hackathon-2026-grid-starter/
*.zst
*.jsonl
*.parquet
*.sqlite
*.duckdb
